# Only the brain's image is built from the repository root, and brain/Dockerfile copies exactly these
# four. Everything else -- the drawings in design/ alone are half the repository -- stays out of the
# build context. A COPY of anything new fails loudly until it is named here.
*
!app/
!brain/
!sounds/
!releases/
app/node_modules/
app/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
